# Native service data (never commit). The pattern is anchored to the
# repository root so it only excludes the top-level runtime data
# directory used by MinIO and PostgreSQL. Nested data directories that
# contain source-controlled fixtures (for example
# backend/app/physics/data/tle/) are not affected.
/data/

